  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[mood:day_bright]Such a dork. Relax and enjoy the moment. Take a deep breath and breathe — because you, Sir, summoned frickin' elementals. Without a monstrous manual, no less.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/001.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "when_flag": "faust_elem_favored",
   "is": "fire",
   "text": "You leaned in. I felt it. Don't pretend you didn't.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/002.mp3"
  },
{
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "when_flag": "faust_elem_favored",
   "is": "water",
   "text": "He held steady. I'll give him that — he held steady while you shouted.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/003.mp3"
  },
{
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "when_flag": "faust_elem_favored",
   "is": "air",
   "text": "You took Air's warning. Fine. Air is always warning somebody.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/004.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "You have to admit — that is worth some mad real-life XP right there. This tinnitus in my ear is like a ding. Methinks I've leveled up.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/005.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "So just roll with it, brother. You're posting good stats. Keep an eye on the endgame. Move the balls down field. And remember to use all the players — (who are players who are players).",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/006.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "It's cool. I get it. But you have to realize certain things about me. Firstly — my life is a work in progress. Second — I've got much to do yet.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/007.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[beat:still]You are flesh. You are decay.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/008.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Everything is broken down, made new.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/009.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Everything is born. Everything dies.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/010.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person]I welcome what's next.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/011.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Alas — our sitting hour is up. You must pee, and break concentration.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting_b/012.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "hide",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
